+++ b/MDL-88683-documentation.md
@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+# Blog links in the user profile (MDL-88683)
+
+When blogs are enabled, the Miscellaneous section of the user profile now shows two blog links, in the same situations where the previous blog link was shown:
+
+* **View my blog entries** (previously "Blog entries") opens the viewed user's own blog entries.
+* **View site blog entries** (new) opens the site-wide blog listing (/blog/index.php).
+
+When blogs are disabled, neither link is shown. Blog pages, permissions and access rules are unchanged. This replaces the Classic theme Navigation block link to site blogs, which is no longer available as Classic is removed in Moodle 5.3.
